BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 681.23 Tm (placed on or read from your device.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 663.43 Tm (That is why they are listed together below, with the technique named.) Tj ET
